' UC-AGA-04 — Review Facility User Onboarding Request

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Central Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access onboarding request review function;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify centralized review authority;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present access-denied result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Retrieve & present pending onboarding requests;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.0 Select onboarding request to review;

|WAHrden System|
:2.1 Check request eligibility;
if (Request exists & still Pending?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present request unavailable/stale status;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :Present full request details & facility context;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.2 Review request information;
if (Review info valid?) then (No [EF-03])
  |WAHrden System|
  :Present validation issue; hold decision;
  kill
else (Yes)
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Review Decision?) then (Approve [3.0])
  :Select Approve;
  |WAHrden System|
  :3.1 Present approval confirmation prompt;
elseif (Modify and Approve [AF-01])
  :Make permitted modifications & select Approve;
  |WAHrden System|
  :Validate modifications & present confirmation;
else (Reject [AF-02])
  :Select Reject;
  |WAHrden System|
  :Present rejection confirmation prompt;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Confirm decision?) then (No / Cancel [EF-04])
  :Cancel review action;
  kill
else (Yes [3.2])
  :Confirm decision;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Validate final status & apply review decision;
if (Request still eligible for decision?) then (No [EF-05])
  :Present decision-not-applicable result;
  kill
elseif (Processing failed?) then (Yes [EF-06])
  :Present review-failure result;
  kill
else (Success)
  |Database / Audit|
  :4.1 Record decision (Approved/Rejected) & audit trail;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :4.2 Present resulting review status;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:Review completed decision output;
stop
@enduml
